初始化先验 prior=[0.5, 0.5] #[P(A), P(B)]

定义转移矩阵 T=[[0.6, 0.4],
              [0.4, 0.6]]

 对于每一个观测z:

     #1. 预测
     predicted = T @ prior

     #2. 计算似然
     if z == O_A:
        likelihood = [P(O_A|A, P(O_A|B)] = [0.8, 0.2]
     else if z == O_B:
        likelihood = [P(O_B|A, P(O_B|B)] = [0.2, 0.8]

     #3. 更新
     posterior = likelihood * predcted       #逐元素相乘
     posterior = posterior / sum(posterior)  #归一化

     #4.  后验作为下一步先验
     prior = posterior

     输出 posterior


